{"id":"n31843-1-8","stage":1,"title":"햄버거 · 汉堡包","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31843-1-8-1","ko":"요즘에는 한국 음식보다 서양 음식을 더 좋아하는 아이들도 많아.","zh":"现在有很多孩子比起韩国料理，更喜欢西餐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에는","audio":"/audio/89b296d651a66ff651ca.mp3"}},{"text":"한국","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国","readings":[{"term":"한국","audio":"/audio/1eb7da6d56d883ca1dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국","audio":"/audio/1eb7da6d56d883ca1dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"음식보다","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식보다","audio":"/audio/7b6473a54df55a893757.mp3"}},{"text":"서양","meaning":"西方，欧美，西洋","explanation":"서양：西方，欧美，西洋","readings":[{"term":"서양","audio":"/audio/1c32a1ded7dbab043e8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66942","senseId":"1","lemma":"서양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서양","audio":"/audio/1c32a1ded7dbab043e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/